{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>2D Girls</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Khara, Sonja, Janis, and Levi. We wanted to make their small story come alive with 2D animation. we hope you enjoy spending a little time with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/extras/320fbf0820375549cd90d464cdbcf4a7.poster.avif?t=1766071987\" width=860 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/extras/320fbf0820375549cd90d464cdbcf4a7.webm?t=1766071987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/extras/320fbf0820375549cd90d464cdbcf4a7.mp4?t=1766071987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Simple Command-Based Action (Approx. 20 Min.)</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex combos needed. Just follow the on-screen arrows (\u2191,\u2193,\u2190,\u2192), time your final SLASH, and enjoy the ride through all 11 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/extras/0d188b8b4170e428af60dac508e05e40.poster.avif?t=1766071987\" width=860 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/extras/0d188b8b4170e428af60dac508e05e40.webm?t=1766071987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/extras/0d188b8b4170e428af60dac508e05e40.mp4?t=1766071987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Satisfying Physics-Based Destruction</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success means one thing: cutting your enemies into countless pieces. watch everything shatter and fly apart from your slashes feels incredibly satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/extras/e9e6cc6394fb6d206f7e10e555b1b251.poster.avif?t=1766071987\" width=860 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/extras/e9e6cc6394fb6d206f7e10e555b1b251.webm?t=1766071987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/extras/e9e6cc6394fb6d206f7e10e555b1b251.mp4?t=1766071987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story (<strong>If you're curious!</strong>)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/extras/856598a7c8da55b5578367a488a853a8.avif?t=1766071987\" width=1560 height=915 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman with red hair roams the town.<br>She is a villain. Khara.<br>But kids don't care about reputations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three of them\u2014Sonja, Janis, and Levi\u2014 run straight up to her. <br>They notice the great sword she carries. <br>They ask her to save their stray cat from danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Khara was getting a little bored, anyway. <br>This looks like a perfect excuse to cut anything, no strings attached.<br>She quietly nods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironically, she is 