static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/extras/856598a7c8da55b5578367a488a853a8.avif?t=1766071987\" width=1560 height=915 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman with red hair roams the town.<br>She is a villain. Khara.<br>But kids don't care about reputations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three of them\u2014Sonja, Janis, and Levi\u2014 run straight up to her. <br>They notice the great sword she carries. <br>They ask her to save their stray cat from danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Khara was getting a little bored, anyway. <br>This looks like a perfect excuse to cut anything, no strings attached.<br>She quietly nods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironically, she is the villain who will save kid's day.</p>","developers":["Heuristic Forge"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942700/92eb9e8e64044b353cf4567f71093c872a64d2a2/header.jpg?t=1766071987","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any up to date version<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.7 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB, OpenGL 3+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3942700/1132704534/8ebdb7102945586c5463535d7365c4463202bf8a/1757847254/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758665089","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3942700/1132704534/8ebdb7102945586c5463535d7365c4463202bf8a/1757847254/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758665089","h